WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:02.168
WASH MY HANDS.

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.370
- OKAY, SWEETIE.
- OKAY.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:04.437
- SEE YOU IN A SECOND.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:09.809
- [laughing]

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:11.878
BUDDY!

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:15.048
- UM, I'M SORRY, UH,
THAT SEAT IS ACTUALLY TAKEN.

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:16.850
MY GIRLFRIEND
IS IN THE BATHROOM,

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.651
AND SHE SHOULD BE BACK
ANY SECOND,

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:20.453
SO YOU CANNOT
SIT THERE.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.389
- YOU DON'T EVEN RECOGNIZE ME,
DO YOU?

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.290
- NO. NO, I D--I DON'T--
I DON'T KNOW YOU.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.292
- WE WERE IN
THAT HUMAN CENTIPEDE TOGETHER!

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.561
- I SAID,
I DO NOT KNOW YOU.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.764
- THREE YEARS AGO,
WE WERE KIDNAPPED

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.599
BY THE CRAZY GERMAN SCIENTIST
WHO SURGICALLY CONNECTED US

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:34.567
INTO A SINGLE HUMAN
DIGESTIVE CHAIN.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.603
THERE WERE THREE OF US,
I WAS IN THE MIDDLE,

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.405
YOU WERE AT THE END,
THE OTHER GUY WAS UP FRONT.

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.040
YOUR MOUTH
WAS SEWN TO MY BUTTHOLE!

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.242
- OKAY, YES,
I REMEMBER!

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:44.310
AND AFTER YEARS OF THERAPY,
I FINALLY PUT THAT BEHIND ME.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.246
- PROBABLY SHOULD'VE SAID
YOU PUT IT BEHIND<i> ME,</i>

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:48.014
IF YOU CATCH MY DRIFT.
[laughing] I'M SORRY.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.749
SORRY!
YOU ALREADY CAUGHT MY DRIFT.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.518
I'M SORRY! [laughs]
THAT'S IT.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.420
IT WAS RIGHT THERE
IN FRONT OF ME.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.355
- REALLY? REALLY?
- [laughing] I'M SORRY.

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:56.389
I GUESS IT WAS RIGHT THERE
IN FRONT OF YOU.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:57.957
THAT'S IT.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.859
[laughing]
I'M SORRY.

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:01.861
HOW ARE YOU DOING?
[laughing] HOW ARE YOU?

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:03.630
- IS THERE SOMETHING ELSE
I CAN HELP YOU WITH?

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:05.398
- UM--OH!
- HEY, [bleep] EATER.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:07.434
- NO [bleep] WAY!
- HEY! [laughs]

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.102
FRONT MAN! [laughs]
- THIS IS A [bleep] NIGHTMARE.

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:10.770
- HEY, BACK MAN.
BACK MAN!

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:12.439
- NO,
DON'T CALL ME THAT.

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:13.406
- AH!
- HEY, COP A SQUAT.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:15.208
- NO!

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.910
- OOH, CHILI.
OLD HABITS DIE HARD?

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.144
[laughs]
- NICE ONE! [laughs]

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.212
- NOW I CAN'T EAT IT.

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:20.980
- OH, WORD?

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.082
- WHY ARE YOU
HAPPY TO SEE HIM?

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.017
- COME ON, MAN!

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:25.852
YOU KNOW, WE ALL SHARED
THE SAME EXPERIENCE.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.520
- NO, WE DIDN'T.
HE WAS IN THE FRONT.

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:28.621
NOBODY
[bleep] IN HIS MOUTH!

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.390
- THAT IS TRUE.

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:32.158
- DO YOU EVER STOP EATING?
EVER?

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:33.126
- ONLY WHEN I'M [bleep].
[laughs]

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:34.727
- OKAY.

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:36.429
- BUT ME AND YOU,
RIGHT?

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.064
- ME AND YOU WHAT?
- I MEAN,

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.866
WE WERE
IN THE SAME BOAT.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.701
- NOPE, YOU TWO
WERE IN THE SAME BOAT.

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:43.603
YOU BOTH [bleep]
IN SOMEONE'S MOUTH.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:44.671
I DIDN'T GET TO [bleep]
IN ANYONE'S MOUTH!

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:46.739
- "GET TO"?

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.708
- WHEN DO I GET TO [bleep]
IN ANYBODY'S MOUTH, HUH?

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:49.742
WHEN DO I GET TO [bleep]
IN SOMEBODY'S MOUTH?

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:50.844
- STEVEN!

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.912
- HON--I--NO.

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:54.347
THESE GUYS--I CAN EXPLAIN THIS.
I CAN EXPLAIN THIS.

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:55.882
YOU--

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.817
OH,<i> YOU'RE</i> DISGUSTED?

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:00.086
YOU--OH, NOW,
YOU'RE GONNA LEAVE?

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:02.455
[scoffs] OH, YEAH.
THAT'S GREAT. OH, YEAH.

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.422
ONCE AGAIN,
I'M THE ASSHOLE.

